        "Rendering start/end failures emit renderError; implicit desktop opening is suppressed in offline mode.",
        "Null-screen fallback for Linux preview placement; no template, formula, data-source, or unrelated engine implementation removed.",
        "PDF-only final label begin/end notifications let the independent helper repair exact Unicode mappings; no text drawing, template geometry or preview layout is replaced."
      ]
